UID:ae1cbcd7b36fa1bfbf86eedeaa829e4e8192026_11:22:49_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Newbury Center Graduate & Professional Student Welcome & Orientation (BUMC)
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375453
DESCRIPTION:Are you a new Boston University Medical Campus (BUMC) first-generation graduate or professional student?\n\nJoin us on September 8, 2026, to learn all about the Newbury Center, upcoming events, and meet fellow first-generation graduate and professional students to start building your Terrier F1RSTS community.\n\nBy attending, you'll get a free Terrier F1RSTS t-shirt, alongside opportunities to win free Newbury Center giveaways!\n\nDinner will be served, so please register ahead by clicking the link.\n\nFirst-Generation Graduate/Professional Student (FGGS/FGPS):\n\nA student who is in the first-generation of their families to pursue an advanced degree (i.e., a student whose parents/guardians/caregivers did not earn a master’s, doctorate, or professional degree, such as a JD or MD).\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375453
END:VEVENT
