UID:63a25d522adc8ec4bf397ad1c6aafe678202026_12:58:09_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Alpha Kappa Psi Information Session 1
LOCATION:Questrom HAR 105, 595 Commonwealth Ave, Boston 02215, United States
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375534
DESCRIPTION:An open, informational session for prospective members interested in learning about our organization. The session includes a presentation on the fraternity's history and mission, an overview of membership benefits (professional development, networking, mentorship, and community), a walkthrough of the recruitment timeline and application process, and a Q&A with current members.\n\nOpen to all interested BU students, no registration required.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375534
END:VEVENT
