UID:8be8792f58c0345783c15997bdf9c67a8152026_10:43:12_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:SHIPWRECKED!
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375350
DESCRIPTION:The first meeting of the year for the Society of Asian Scientists and Engineers! Attendees will be introduced to our club and mission as well as collaborate in an art project of designing ships from one piece. These ships will be built with simple materials like tape, popsicle sticks, and aluminum foil. The group with the most innovative and artistic design will come out victorious!\n\nAdditionally, attendees will be entered into a raffle when they complete the sign in form, and a prize(s) will be random given out. May the best shipwright win!\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375350
END:VEVENT
