UID:2932d95c7b7f9a8a6fd9e97004598dd98192026_11:33:14_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Newbury Center Welcome & Orientation for Graduate & Professional Students (Charles River Campus)
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375454
DESCRIPTION:Are you searching for an opportunity to meet new first-gen graduate & professional students at the Boston University Charles River Campus? \n\nJump right in, and come to our upcoming welcome social. The Newbury Center team looks forward to meeting you, and facilitating fun activities during the evening.\n \nDesigned for new incoming first-gen graduate and professional students on the Charles River Campus & on-campus BU MET students; however, if this date works best for local BUMC & BU Online students, then come join us in person.\n\nBy attending, you'll get a free Terrier F1RSTS t-shirt, alongside opportunities to win free Newbury Center giveaways!\n\nDinner will be served, so please register ahead by clicking the link.\n\nFirst-Generation Graduate/Professional Student (FGGS/FGPS):\n\nA student who is in the first-generation of their families to pursue an advanced degree (i.e., a student whose parents/guardians/caregivers did not earn a master’s, doctorate, or professional degree, such as a JD or MD).\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375454
END:VEVENT
