LOCATION:CAS 322, 725 Commonwealth Avenue, Boston, MA 02215, United States
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375581
DESCRIPTION:Event Description: BURSA Unwrapped is BU BURSA's first general meeting of the semester designed to introduce students to Burmese culture, meet new people, and learn about upcoming BURSA events in a fun and welcoming environment. The event will feature a short introduction to BURSA, pre-packaged asian snacks, interactive icebreaker games, and prizes. The event is open to all students regardless of cultural background and aims to foster community among both Burmese and non-Burmese students.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375581
END:VEVENT
