SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Alpha Kappa Psi DEI Night
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375535
DESCRIPTION:DEI Night is one of our chapter’s recruitment events focused on introducing prospective members to Alpha Kappa Psi’s approach to diversity, equity, and inclusion. The event will begin with a presentation highlighting the initiatives our chapter has implemented to build a more welcoming and inclusive organization. This will include how DEI is considered within recruitment, member development, chapter programming, and the overall member experience.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375535
