UID:927f774523f1ab7eaf40750e7043272f8282026_10:07:58_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:First of All: The Crash Course to BU
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375762
DESCRIPTION: First of All: The Crash Course to BU is an interactive program for our Welcome Week festivities designed to provide incoming BU freshmen with the practical advice, peer mentorship, and campus knowledge that students often learn only after spending months or years at college.\n\nThe event will create a relaxed environment where freshmen can eat pizza, meet upperclassmen in the chapter, ask candid questions, work through common first-year scenarios, and leave with a concrete plan for navigating their first month at BU.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375762
END:VEVENT
