SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:AIAA DBF Interest Meeting
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376037
DESCRIPTION:Want to get engineering experience? Join the AIAA Design/Build/Fly (DBF) team! We are a student run team that builds an uncrewed RC aircraft to take on an international competition. Stop by our interest meeting to learn about our goals for the year, the different teams you can join, and what to expect. No prior experience necessary!\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376037
END:VEVENT
