LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375536
DESCRIPTION:A recruitment event where prospective members receive hands-on guidance on building and polishing their resumes. Current members review attendees' resumes one-on-one, share feedback, and offer tips on formatting, phrasing, and tailoring for internships and full-time roles.\n\nThe event includes a short presentation on resume best practices followed by open review and networking. Open to all interested BU students.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375536
END:VEVENT
