UID:22c595614c3724a05d37a7fdd88bc864972026_12:18:21_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:RSS Welcome Quest
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376164
DESCRIPTION:Join the BU Russian-Speaking Community for our first event of the semester! The evening will begin with a short introduction to the organization and its e-board, followed by an interactive team-based quest designed to help participants meet one another and engage with Russian-speaking culture in a fun and welcoming environment.\nParticipants will rotate through several activity stations featuring group games, trivia, music-based challenges, and logic tasks. Teams will work together to complete each station and progress through the quest, ultimately competing to find the final prize. \nThe event is open to students interested in Russian-speaking culture and community, regardless of their level of Russian proficiency. The goal of the event is to encourage social interaction, introduce students to the organization, and create a welcoming environment for new and returning members\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376164
END:VEVENT
