UID:ec4076949c38217db4d244e39eab8fa88202026_4:05:56_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Newbury Center Red Sox Field Trip 
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375544
DESCRIPTION:Join a group of first-gen BU students for a night at the ballpark! We will be travelling to Fenway Park to watch the Red Sox play on Tuesday, September 22, 2026. The group will meet outside of Fenway Park at 6:15 pm. Ticket costs for the game will be covered by the Newbury Center.\n\nIf you are interested in attending, please fill out this form to enter our field trip lottery, as we have limited spaces available. Winners will be selected and notified on Monday, September 14, and will be asked to pay a $5 deposit to hold their space (all deposits will be repaid upon attendance of the event). Please consider joining us for this wonderful opportunity to enjoy a fun activity with fellow Terrier F1RSTS!\n\nOur hope is to bring as many first-gen students who have not yet had the chance to see a Red Sox baseball game since it is one way to engage with the local Boston community. Cheering on local sports teams is an opportunity to meet new people and experience city life near campus. \n\nIf deposits are not paid by NOON on Wednesday, September 16, spaces will be reassigned to individuals on the waitlist.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375544
END:VEVENT
