UID:609f7dd786014f3b8ea0f37c880486729102026_11:01:18_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:BBSA Kickoff 
LOCATION:Questrom Room 408, 775 Commonwealth Ave, Boston, MA 02215, United States
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376344
DESCRIPTION:BBSA Kickoff will take place on Wednesday, September 24th from 5:30–7:00 PM in QST 408, welcoming new, first-year members, and returning members into the club for the semester ahead. After sign-in and a quick e-board introduction covering BBSA's plans for the semester, attendees will jump into a speed-networking-style icebreaker before diving into the night's main activity, BBSA Hot Takes, a lively stand-if-you-agree debate game where members react to bold prompts and defend their positions while e-board members stir the competition from the crowd. The night will wrap with a preview of the semester's biggest events, including the NYC trek and mentorship program, followed by a feedback form and info on how to stay connected through BBSA's GroupMe and Instagram. With free Domino's pizza and drinks provided, it's the perfect low-pressure way to meet the club, make new connections, and see what BBSA has in store this year.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376344
END:VEVENT
