DESCRIPTION:Have questions about financial aid? BU's Office of Financial Assistance with be hosting a pop-up at the Newbury Center on Friday, September 25th, from 12:00-2:00pm. Sign up for a 15-minute slot below to get your financial aid questions answered!\n\nhttps://www.signupgenius.com/go/10C0C4EAEA62EAAFEC52-65430440-office#/ \n\nIntended audience is undergraduate students.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375978
