SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:RSS Muzloto
LOCATION:FLR 152 , 808 Commonwealth Avenue, Brookline, MA  02215, United States
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377000
DESCRIPTION:Think you know your music? Come put it to the test at Russian Speaking Society’s Muzloto Night!\nYou’ll get a card with 25 song titles, and as songs play, your goal is to identify them and mark them off. Guess 20 songs correctly to win. The playlist will mix classic Russian songs, newer Russian hits and new wave, and popular American music, so you definitely don’t need to be an expert in Russian music to join.\nCome with friends, compete against other teams, discover some new songs, and see how many tracks you can recognize. Everyone is welcome, regardless of Russian-language ability or music knowledge.\nAnd yes, there will be a prize for the winner!\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377000
END:VEVENT
