DTSTART:20260927T180000Z
DTEND:20260927T200000Z
UID:ea9fbd876d76c787fcdaf468bcd644669232026_12:12:03_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:2K Tournament
LOCATION: Howard Thurman Center for Common Ground (HTC), Room 207, 808 Commonwealth Avenue, Boston, MA 02215, United States
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377115
DESCRIPTION:“2K Tournament”, hosted by Brothers United, is a PS5 NBA 2K tournament designed to bring men of colour and other underrepresented students at Boston University together through friendly competition, fellowship, and shared interests. Participants will compete against one another in NBA 2K while having the opportunity to connect with fellow students in a relaxed and engaging environment.\n\nThe event aims to use video games and friendly competition as a way to encourage camaraderie, build new friendships, and strengthen connections among members of underrepresented communities on campus. While the tournament will provide a fun and competitive experience, the larger goal is to create an inclusive social space where students can unwind, interact with one another, and develop a stronger sense of community and belonging at BU.\n\n \n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377115
END:VEVENT
