SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:BUCD Hosts Voter Registration Day
LOCATION:GSU Link, 775 Commonwealth Ave, Boston, MA 02215, United States
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376877
DESCRIPTION:Boston University College Democrats wants to host a day-long tabling event encouraging people to register to vote and informing them of different voting laws depending on the states they are from. This endeavor is nonpartisan and we will reach out to other clubs on campus to ask if they want to send volunteers to table. We want to have three tables - one to actively register people to vote, one on how to request a mail-in ballot, and one on any questions surrounding the voting process. We are hoping for this event to be outside on Marsh Plaza and are going to have the tables be staffed by general members of our own organization. We don't need many more supplies besides informational flyers, posters, and the tables. \n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376877
END:VEVENT
