SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:BU Novice APDA Tournament
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376448
DESCRIPTION:The BU Novice Tournament is designed to give first-time debaters from all participating schools a welcoming introduction to competitive debate. We will host a two-day event with beginner-friendly rounds, mentorship from experienced debaters, and meals to ensure accessibility. This directly supports our mission to make debate inclusive and low-pressure for all students, especially those new to the activity. The tournament removes common barriers (cost, experience, intimidation) that often prevent beginners from joining.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376448
END:VEVENT
