UID:a122d8b6be87b89548c9a99da5efdd629232026_4:44:21_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Homecoming Party (COPY)
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377161
DESCRIPTION:The purpose of SoulAAn’s Homecoming Party is to build community, school spirit, and cultural connection by creating a fun and welcoming space where students can come together, celebrate, and feel connected to BU. Although BU does not have a traditional football-centered homecoming experience, this event gives students an opportunity to still experience BU pride, participate in a campus tradition, and celebrate homecoming in a way that reflects Black culture, music, and community. For many students, especially Black students and students from underrepresented communities, events like this help make campus feel more welcoming, lively, and connected.Funding this event is important because the atmosphere of a homecoming party depends heavily on music, energy, and intentional programming. Our DJ would also not just serve background music for this event; the DJ helps guide the flow of the night, keep students engaged, and create a safe and organized party environment, to make the event feel like a real homecoming celebration rather than just a room rental. The requested funding would allow us to provide quality music and entertainment, decorate the space, and create an experience that encourages students to build relationships, show school pride, and feel represented in campus life. This event would also help SoulAAn establish a new tradition for BU students who may not otherwise feel connected to traditional homecoming culture. By investing in this event, the university would be supporting student belonging, cultural celebration, and community-building across campus and the greater Boston intercollegiate Black community.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377161
END:VEVENT
