UID:275279acb7cd79fb7b747b975e7e271b9262026_11:35:17_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Field Day
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377243
DESCRIPTION:The Organization of Pakistani Students (OPS), in collaboration with other South Asian student organizations including SASA and BU Bangla, will host a community Field Day designed to bring students together through friendly competition and outdoor activities. Participants will have the opportunity to play a variety of recreational sports and games, including basketball, badminton, handball, soccer, and other team-based activities. The event is open to BU students and attendees will be able to rotate between games, meet new people, and enjoy an afternoon of fun, teamwork, and cultural connection in a relaxed and inclusive environment.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377243
END:VEVENT
