LOCATION:CAS 228, 808 Commonwealth Avenue, Brookline, MA  02215, United States
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377539
DESCRIPTION:Russian Speaking Society invites you to a relaxed evening of board and card games! We’ll have a mix of strategy games, party games, and classic card games, so there will be something for everyone, whether you play regularly or just want to hang out and try something new.\nCome on your own or bring friends, we’ll help everyone find a group and a game to join. Expect some friendly competition, plenty of conversation, and probably at least a few rounds that turn into “one more game.”\nEveryone is welcome, regardless of Russian-language ability or prior experience with board games.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377539
END:VEVENT
