SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Pre-Health Advising Drop-Ins for First-Gen Students 
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377187
DESCRIPTION:The pre-health advising team is coming to you! We're hosting Pop-Up advising sessions at various campus locations you frequent most, offering a convenient opportunity to meet with our advisors. In this informal, group office-hour format, you can discuss your most pressing pre-health questions and get personalized guidance. To make the most of your time, we recommend completing the "Introduction to the Pre-Health Pathway" module before attending. The module is accessible via our Pre-health 101 Blackboard site.\n\nEvent is intented for undergraduate students.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377187
