UID:d5515953d0d164d031cd89df0d2be2419222026_3:26:43_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE: Red Star Theater's Fall 2026 Performance — Suspect Zero
LOCATION:Boston University Student Theater at Agganis Arena, Boston University Student Theater at Agganis Arena, Boston 02215, United States
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377063
DESCRIPTION:This Fall 2026, Red Star Theater proudly presents Suspect Zero (0号嫌疑人).\n\nA violent storm. A mysterious murder. Six people, each with something to hide.\n\nWhen a wealthy man is found dead in his villa, six people find themselves trapped under the same roof. As secrets come to light and suspicions grow, everyone becomes a suspect.\n\nWho is telling the truth? Who has something to hide? And who is the real killer?\n\nBlending mystery, comedy, and unexpected twists, Suspect Zero takes audiences on a thrilling journey full of secrets, laughter, and surprises.\n\nCreated and performed by Boston University students, Suspect Zero invites you to follow the clues, question everyone, and uncover the truth.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377063
END:VEVENT
