DESCRIPTION:The event will celebrate the writers, artists, and student voices featured in this edition. A table will be set up at the entrance of the room where attendees can pick up a physical copy of the issue. All featured writers will have the opportunity to read their published works aloud. The event will conclude with a featured open mic, inviting anyone from the community to share their own creative work. For the event setup, tables and chairs will be arranged facing the stage, where there will be a microphone.\n\nMeeting Link: https://us04web.zoom.us/j/72853086371?pwd=CXmvPTw8Cya3eRp6v8GI5rbDNNG4a4.1\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377478
