UID:cfecad40f43a65e6f18760eafe07ef7e9132026_2:24:38_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Empowering Healthy Habits
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376444
DESCRIPTION:This program will kick off A Pham World by following Alpha Phi Alpha Fraternity, Incorporated National Program, Project Alpha, and Alpha Kappa Alpha Sorority, Incorporated initiative, Health Awareness & Well-Being. This program will educate young adults about health awareness, wellness education, and healthy decision making while having open conversations about health within the Black community to break stigmas surrounding seeking support. The attendees will use what they learned throughout the program to answer questions in a fun trivia game at the end. \n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376444
END:VEVENT
