DESCRIPTION:This open house is perfect for BU students interested in exploring a major, minor, or class at the School of Hospitality Administration (SHA). Experience how our undergraduate and graduate programs are shaped by Boston’s leading hospitality professionals, including renowned restaurant owners of Boston’s award-winning restaurants, featured at this event.\n\nEnjoy signature dishes from Mahaniyom, MIDA, and Shy Bird, owned by Boston University alumni who teach and guest lecture at SHA. Plus, enter to win gift cards from participating restaurants!\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=375814
