UID:ebd88ab49173047c382ad2796f0a481a9132026_2:16:45_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Every Soul Serves
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376440
DESCRIPTION:The program will begin with a presentation on strengthening relationships, communication, and community support while following the Big Brothers Big Sisters of America and AKA Family Matters initiatives. Attendees will discuss the importance of  mentorship, healthy family dynamics, chosen families, and the importance of positive role models in young people's lives. Following the presentation, the program will conclude with a community service project where attendees will assemble care packages and write letters of encouragement for local youth and families.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376440
END:VEVENT
