UID:abe2b5dcd319ff02d589e0c6bc8ef78e10202026_2:22:43_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:BAZU matcha pop up
LOCATION:GSU, 775 Commonwealth Ave, Boston, MA 02215, United States
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377872
DESCRIPTION:The Organization of Pakistani Students (OPS) is collaborating with BAZU Matcha, a new student-run matcha pop-up at Boston University, to host a free matcha giveaway at the GSU. Located by the pianos, our table will be open to all BU students passing by to stop, grab a complimentary matcha, and connect with our community. This collaboration aims to support a student-led business while introducing more students to OPS, our upcoming events, and Pakistani culture. Through this casual and welcoming tabling event, we hope to engage with the broader BU community, celebrate cultural diversity, and encourage new students to get involved with OPS. All are welcome, and no registration is required!\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377872
END:VEVENT
