DESCRIPTION:It's spooky season!\n\nThis year, our student-run fashion societies, magazines, and creative groups will be coming together for a Halloween party at the BU Castle! Open to all BU students, we are encouraging everyone to show up and show out in their best costumes, and be prepared for a night of contests, raffles and more! \n\nNote: While this is a huge event for our organizations, we have discussed the gorgeous architecture of the Castle and are committed to respecting the structure and space of the Castle. \n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377070
