UID:2126177c2146802d0ccc1003ec4e0f501072026_2:23:49_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Elections Midterm Watch Party
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377581
DESCRIPTION:The midterms watch party hosted by Student Governments City Affairs Department will have a live streaming of a news broadcast that shows midterm polling and coverage across the country. There will be catering onsite as well for students to eat as they watch as well as a fun interactive bingo sheets that students can mark off as votes roll in. Stickers would be handed out for students who attend. It is a way to round off Terrier Turnout Week 2026 and help students become politically literate and bond over democracy. \n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=377581
END:VEVENT
