UID:d2471bc442b284fd7bdb0904ab0f7df49132026_5:31:47_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Northeastern University APDA Tournament
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376475
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern’s Pro-Am format pairs novices with varsity debaters, creating unmatched mentorship and accelerating new members’ growth. The collaborative environment breaks down barriers for beginners while strengthening team bonds—many BU debaters form lasting partnerships here. As our most accessible in-person tournament, it’s a cornerstone of our recruitment and retention.\n---\nEvent Details: https://terriercentral.bu.edu/rsvp?id=376475
END:VEVENT
